# Prisma Conventions

## Naming

- All fields use `snake_case` via `@map` / `@@map`
- Tables: `@@map("snake_case_table_name")`
- Columns: `@map("snake_case_column")`

## Transactions

- Use `prisma.$transaction()` for operations that must be atomic
- Variant/VariantBarcode/Listing: always derive `companyId` from relation inside transaction — never from request body

## Migrations

- Add `COMMENT ON TABLE` and `COMMENT ON COLUMN` in migrations (Russian comments)
- Add `COMMENT ON TYPE "EnumName"` for enums — Prisma may recreate enums and drop comments; verify after migration (see runbook)
- Enum values = API contract; change only via migration + changelog
